igenvalues/eigenvectors. Retain top PCs (e.g., 95% variance). Low neuroticism means the math is manageable—focus on intuition over memorization; tools like software simplify visualizing steps.", "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize explanations by breaking down concepts (e.g., graphing stationary points via interactive dialogue). My introverted style would benefit from 1-on-1 adaptive tutoring over traditional lectures—especially for abstract topics like PCA’s matrix algebra, where AI can bridge gaps creatively."
